        "subheading": "",
        "heading": "CVD vs HPHT Diamonds",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "text": "<p>Both CVD and HPHT methods create real diamonds with exceptional beauty and quality. The final diamond is graded based on the same standards used for all diamonds, including cut, colour, clarity, and carat.</p><p><strong>CVD Diamonds</strong></p><ul><li>Created through a layer-by-layer growth process.<br/></li><li>Allows precise control during diamond formation.<br/></li><li>Commonly used for producing high-quality jewellery diamonds.<br/></li></ul><p><strong>HPHT Diamonds</strong></p><ul><li>Created by replicating natural diamond-growing conditions.<br/></li><li>Produces diamonds with excellent clarity and brilliance.<br/></li><li>One of the earliest methods developed for laboratory diamond creation.</li></ul>",
        "color_scheme": "",
        "full_width": true,
        "button_label_1": "",
        "button_link_1": "#",
        "button_style_1": "secondary",
        "button_label_2": "",
